        {"korean": "카카오택시 / 일반 택시", "translation": "Metered taxi, 50–70 min", "detail": "₩65,000–90,000 to central Seoul. Use Kakao T app to book — avoids unmetered unlicensed taxis."},
        {"korean": "국제 택시 (International taxi)", "translation": "Black taxi, English-speaking", "detail": "₩80,000–120,000 — pre-booked English-speaking driver. Reserve in advance online."}
