      "title": "Warning",
      "sectionType": "WARNING",
      "items": [
        {"detail": "KTX and SRT seats sell out during major Korean holidays — Chuseok (추석, autumn harvest) and Seollal (설날, Lunar New Year). Book at least 2–3 weeks ahead during these periods. Unmetered taxis outside Incheon Airport can overcharge — always use metered taxis or Kakao T."}
